  "details": "So I've tried out making an avatar without the use of full body IK, and the animations look better in some specific cases for certain avatars, however there's just one problem, crouching is impossible with these avatars, what if we had a system where depending on the head height, it would use different animations? (it would also be nice if we could have gesture overrides working with these avatars)\nTLDR: change the way avatars without IK animate, making them switch between idle animations based on head height, and hand gesture overrides still be usable, this shouldn't be that difficult...",
